# ==============================================================================
# HOTEL RAAMA — CLOUDFLARE STATIC ASSET CACHING RULES (_headers)
# ==============================================================================
# Total Rules: 74 rules (Cloudflare Pages / Workers Static Assets limit: 100 rules)
# Complies strictly with Cloudflare path globbing & exact path matching standards.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. IMMUTABLE BUILD ASSETS (Hashed JS & CSS bundles generated by Vite)
# Filenames contain cryptographic hashes (e.g., index-DQSXCGF0.js, index-BAbI2X6S.css).
# Safe for 1-year aggressive immutable caching at Cloudflare edge and in browser.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. STATIC MEDIA ASSETS — ROOT DIRECTORY (Un-hashed public images & video)
# Safe 30-day cache with 1-day stale-while-revalidate for fast edge delivery.
# NO immutable flag, allowing revalidation if media is replaced across builds.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
